      | Group Name  | Group ID | Group Description                 |
      +=============+==========+===================================+
      | R&D Regular | foo-10   | R&D employees                     |
      +-------------+----------+-----------------------------------+
      | R&D BYOD    | foo-11   | Personal devices of R&D employees |
